   "no": 3,
   "en": "DATA",
   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>这个场景的标注是「<strong>点状</strong>」的：不需要给 10 万片切片逐一贴标签，只需要几十到二百个<strong>井点</strong>——测井相解释经时深转换投到井旁道即可。真正要花心思的是<strong>统一相带分类方案</strong>：先和地质人员把类别体系定下来（分几类、每一类的判据），模型才有一个稳定的「答案册」。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 3 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 3</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>地震切片 / 小立方体</span><span class='cl-s'>单区块 1 万—10 万片，统一相位与增益</span></span><span class='cl-n'>井点标定相带标签 50—200 个</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>测井相解释</span><span class='cl-s'>井点岩性与沉积相，时深转换后对齐</span></span><span class='cl-n'>作为标签来源，逐井复核</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>沉积背景资料</span><span class='cl-s'>岩心、露头类比、区域沉积模式</span></span><span class='cl-n'>定性参考，用于相带方案与复核</span></div></div>"
